      "**AI authoring:** upload your existing SOPs, PDFs or videos and get a first draft of step-by-step instructions to review.",
      "**AR guidance:** operators follow each step on a tablet or AR glasses (Apple Vision Pro, HoloLens 2, Android XR), with the overlay on the actual part.",
      "**Audit trail:** every execution logs time, confirmations and deviations automatically.",
      "**Continuous improvement:** operators flag issues per step, so you know what to revise.",
      "**Pilot first:** we start with one line and fixed KPIs, with technology partner DeepSight."
