   "answer": "Vision Pro vs HoloLens: Microsoft has discontinued HoloLens 2 and supports it with security fixes until 31 December 2027. Existing fleets can keep running, but new rollouts should plan on current devices such as Apple Vision Pro or Android XR headsets. Actarion supports all three, so your instructions move with you.",
