   "answer": "A connected worker is a frontline employee who uses digital tools, such as tablets, AR glasses and apps, to get instructions, data and expert help during the task, and whose work is recorded. Actarion delivers connected worker solutions: AI-generated work instructions, AR guidance, skills tracking and remote assistance.",
