   "metaDescription": "GMP (good manufacturing practice) sets rules for consistent, controlled production of medicines and food. Learn key principles and the role of records.",
   "h1": "What Is GMP? Good Manufacturing Practice",
   "lead": "GMP (good manufacturing practice) sets rules for consistent, controlled production of medicines and food. Learn key principles and the role of records.",
   "answer": "GMP, or good manufacturing practice, is the set of regulations and guidelines that ensures medicines, food and similar products are produced consistently and controlled to quality standards. Documented procedures and records are central. Actarion supports GMP with controlled digital work instructions and an audit trail per execution.",
