   "lead": "LOTO (lockout/tagout) isolates machines from hazardous energy during maintenance. Learn the steps, an example and how digital LOTO creates proof.",
   "answer": "LOTO, or lockout/tagout, is a safety procedure that isolates a machine from all hazardous energy and locks it, so it cannot start during maintenance or cleaning. Each person applies a personal lock and tag. Actarion guides LOTO step by step on tablet or AR glasses and logs every isolation point.",
