   "h1": "SMED Checklist: Free Changeover Template for Faster Setups",
   "lead": "Free SMED checklist for faster changeovers: before, during and after the stop, plus an internal/external analysis sheet. With fill-in guide and example.",
   "answer": "A SMED checklist makes sure everything needed for a changeover is ready before the machine stops, and that each changeover follows the same sequence. SMED (Single-Minute Exchange of Die) separates internal work, done while the machine is stopped, from external work, done while it runs. This free SMED checklist covers both, plus an analysis sheet.",
